tars and snowflakes (9 min), 2) ''Hanukkah Decorations'' - blue and white crafts (9 min), 3) ''Multicultural Celebration'' - diverse cultural decoration making (9 min).','Decoration celebration gallery: Students display their decorations around room and take appreciation walk, saying ''C''est beau!'' to classmates'' work. End with group appreciation of all cultural decorations created.','Écrire le concept de créons nos; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653494,1757594654059,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Focus on simple color and decoration vocabulary","Provide pre-cut materials and simple assembly","Use larger, easier-to-handle materials","Accept any creative decoration attempt"],"pourAvancés":["Create more complex decorations with multiple steps","Help classmates with decoration projects","Learn about decoration symbolism in different cultures","Design original decoration patterns"],"pourLangue":["Connect to decoration traditions from home cultures","Use decoration as universal creative language","Allow sharing decoration vocabulary in home language","Focus on hands-on creative activities"],"pourPEI":["Adapt craft activities for fine motor abilities","Provide alternative decoration methods","Use preferred colors or materials","Allow flexible participation in decoration activities"]}','{"vocabulary":["décorer","couleurs","créer"],"visualSupports":["Color vocab