INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3xy00htvj9tzm6hbxm3',23,'Notre festival d''hiver multiculturel','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',1768492800000,45,'Festival preparation circle: Students gather to see all their winter celebration work displayed around room. Practice ''partager'' by sharing one favorite memory from winter celebration learning. Introduce ''festival'' as special celebration time ''ensemble''.','Multicultural winter festival celebration: Students rotate through celebration stations featuring all cultures studied - Christmas corner, Hanukkah area, Kwanzaa station, New Year celebration, winter foods, music, and decorations. Each station has activities from previous lessons.','Unity celebration circle: All students gather with one item from festival (decoration, instrument, picture). Each says ''Toutes les célébrations sont belles!'' Group responds ''Oui, c''est beau ensemble!'' End with group appreciation of winter celebration learning journey.','Raconter les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par des activités langagières variées','["All student work from previous lessons displayed","Festival welcome sign","Memory sharing picture prompts","Circle gathering area","All decorations created in previous lessons","Cultural celebration station setups","Musical instruments and songs from lesson 12","Food pictures and pretend food from lesson 11","Lanterns and lights from lesson 9","Noise makers from lesson 10","Cultural celebration music playlist","Station rotation system","Celebration costumes/props (optional)","Student choice of festival items to hold","Unity circle sitting arrangement","Group response cards","Appreciation and gratitude visual supports"]',NULL,'Notre festival d''hiver multiculturel','Festival preparation circle: Students gather to see all their winter celebration work displayed around room. Practice ''partager'' by sharing one favorite memory from winter celebration learning. Introduce ''festival'' as special celebration time ''ensemble''.','Multicultural winter festival celebration: Students rotate through celebration stations featuring all cultures studied - Christmas corner, Hanukkah area, Kwanzaa station, New Year celebration, winter foods, music, and decorations. Each station has activities from previous lessons.','Unity celebration circle: All students gather with one item from festival (decoration, instrument, picture). Each says ''Toutes les célébrations sont belles!'' Group responds ''Oui, c''est beau ensemble!'' End with group appreciation of winter celebration learning journey.','Raconter les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653494,1757594654060,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Focus on familiar festival elements","Provide structured station participation with support","Use simple celebration vocabulary","Allow observation participation when needed"],"pourAvancés":["Help facilitate festival stations","Explain cultural celebrations to younger students if available","Lead group in multicultural appreciation activities","Create connections between different celebrations"],"pourLangue":["Highlight celebrations from students'' home cultures when possible","Use festival as celebration of cultural diversity including their backgrounds","Allow sharing in home languages during festival","Focus on universal celebration joy"],"pourPEI":["Adapt festival participation to sensory and social needs","Provide quiet celebration alternatives","Use preferred celebration elements","Allow flexible participation in group festival activities"]}','{"vocabulary":["festival","partager","ensemble"],"visualSupports":["Winter celebration learning journey photo display, ''festival'' vocabulary card with celebration images, ''partager'' and ''ensemble'' action cards","Station identification signs with pictures, cultural celebration summary posters, respectful celebration participation guidelines, multicultural appreciation displays","Unity celebration phrase poster, multicultural appreciation chart, celebration gratitude cards"],"movementBreaks":["Memory sharing gestures","''Ensemble'' togetherness movements","Station rotation movements","Cultural music dancing","Celebration actions at each station","Unity circle gathering movements","Appreciation gestures for all cultures"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,14,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3xz00hvvj9t09vp9m1k',23,'Histoires d''hiver magiques','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',1768579200000,45,'Story circle magic: Students sit in cozy circle with dim lighting and winter scene backdrop. Teacher introduces story time with ''Il était une fois...'' (Once upon a time) and shows beautiful winter story illustrations. Students practice story listening position.','Winter story exploration: Teacher reads 2-3 short winter stories from different cultures, pausing for student predictions and connections. Students use story props to act out favorite parts and create story illustrations.','Story sharing circle: Students show their story illustrations and share one word or phrase from their favorite winter story. Group appreciates each story with gentle ''applause rain'' (finger tapping).','Communiquer les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Raconter les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par la narration','["Cozy circle rugs or pillows","Dim lighting setup (lamps instead of overhead)","Winter scene backdrop or poster","Beautiful winter story book collection","3-4 short cultural winter stories","Story prop basket: artificial snowflakes, stars, winter animals, lights","Drawing paper and crayons for story illustrations","Story sequence cards for retelling","Cultural winter storybooks from different countries","Student story illustrations","Story sharing circle area","''Applause rain'' demonstration"]',NULL,'Histoires d''hiver magiques','Story circle magic: Students sit in cozy circle with dim lighting and winter scene backdrop. Teacher introduces story time with ''Il était une fois...'' (Once upon a time) and shows beautiful winter story illustrations. Students practice story listening position.','Winter story exploration: Teacher reads 2-3 short winter stories from different cultures, pausing for student predictions and connections. Students use story props to act out favorite parts and create story illustrations.','Story sharing circle: Students show their story illustrations and share one word or phrase from their favorite winter story. Group appreciates each story with gentle ''applause rain'' (finger tapping).','Communiquer les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Raconter les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par la narration',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653495,1757594654061,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Use stories with lots of pictures and simple plots","Provide story props for hands-on engagement","Accept gesture and pointing responses","Focus on story enjoyment over comprehension"],"pourAvancés":["Encourage story predictions and connections","Ask to help retell stories to classmates","Create original story endings","Learn additional story vocabulary"],"pourLangue":["Use universal story elements and visual supports","Connect to similar stories from home cultures","Allow story discussion in home language","Focus on story emotions and actions"],"pourPEI":["Provide comfortable seating and positioning","Use preferred story themes or characters","Allow movement during story time if needed","Adapt story activities to individual communication needs"]}','{"vocabulary":["histoire","tradition","famille"],"visualSupports":["''Il était une fois'' story starter card, story listening behavior poster, winter story covers display","Story prediction picture cards, cultural story comparison chart, story element identification posters, winter story vocabulary with pictures","Story sharing sentence starters, appreciation gesture cards, favorite story vocabulary support"],"movementBreaks":["Gentle settling movements","Story listening position practice","Story acting with props","Character movements and actions","Drawing and illustration activities","Story illustration sharing movements","''Applause rain'' appreciation gestures"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,15,'extension',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y000hxvj9tm8uj27y5',23,'Jeux d''hiver intérieurs','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',1768838400000,45,'Game discovery time: Show pictures of children playing different winter games around the world. Students guess how each game is played through gestures and movements. Introduce concept of ''jeux'' (games) that keep people happy during winter.','Cultural winter game stations: Students rotate through 3 adapted traditional games - simple board game from one culture, movement game from another, and cooperative game from third culture. Each game adapted for indoor classroom play.','Game appreciation circle: Each student demonstrates one movement or action from their favorite game played today. Group tries to guess which game and culture it represents. End with appreciation for all games and cultures.','Exprimer les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Participer à les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par le jeu dirigé','["Cultural winter game photo collection","Game guessing prompt cards","Movement demonstration space","Simple cultural board game (adapted)","Game pieces and boards for 8 students","Movement game materials (scarves, soft balls)","Cooperative game materials (rope, parachute, or large cloth)","3 game station setups","Game instruction picture cards","Cultural game context photos","Timer for station rotations","Circle gathering space","Game demonstration area","Cultural game reference cards for guessing"]',NULL,'Jeux d''hiver intérieurs','Game discovery time: Show pictures of children playing different winter games around the world. Students guess how each game is played through gestures and movements. Introduce concept of ''jeux'' (games) that keep people happy during winter.','Cultural winter game stations: Students rotate through 3 adapted traditional games - simple board game from one culture, movement game from another, and cooperative game from third culture. Each game adapted for indoor classroom play.','Game appreciation circle: Each student demonstrates one movement or action from their favorite game played today. Group tries to guess which game and culture it represents. End with appreciation for all games and cultures.','Exprimer les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Participer à les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer la compréhension par le jeu dirigé',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653496,1757594654062,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Simplify game rules to basic movements or actions","Provide partner support during games","Focus on participation rather than game mastery","Use familiar game elements when possible"],"pourAvancés":["Learn more complex game rules and strategies","Help explain games to classmates","Create variations or combinations of games","Research origins and cultural significance of games"],"pourLangue":["Use games as universal play language","Connect to similar games from home cultures","Focus on movement and action rather than verbal instructions","Allow game discussion in home language"],"pourPEI":["Adapt game rules and materials for individual abilities","Provide alternative participation methods","Use preferred game elements or activities","Allow flexible engagement with game activities"]}','{"vocabulary":["jeux","jouer","amusant"],"visualSupports":["''Jeux d''hiver'' vocabulary poster, game identification pictures, movement gesture cards","Game instruction cards with pictures and simple words, cultural game origin posters, cooperation and fair play reminder cards","Game demonstration cards, cultural appreciation posters, ''favorite game'' sharing prompts"],"movementBreaks":["Game guessing movements and gestures throughout opening","Movement games built into activity","Station transitions with game-themed movements","Individual game demonstrations","Group guessing movements and responses"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,16,'extension',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y100hzvj9t0zu1wg2d',23,'Cartes de vœux multiculturelles','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',1768924800000,45,'Greeting card exploration: Show beautiful example cards from different cultures and celebrations. Students practice different cultural greetings with gestures. Introduce card-making as way to share celebration wishes with others.','Multicultural card creation workshop: Students choose which cultural celebration card to make, then create personalized greeting cards using appropriate cultural symbols, colors, and greetings. Focus on respectful representation and personal creativity.','Card sharing and gifting circle: Students present their cards and practice giving them with appropriate cultural greetings. Exchange cards with classmates or prepare to take home to families. Appreciate diversity of celebrations represented.','Décrire le concept de cartes de; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer l''expression écrite par des activités langagières variées','["Collection of multicultural greeting cards","Cultural greeting gesture cards","Example of card-giving demonstration","Card-making station with folded card blanks (25)","Cultural color collections (red/green, blue/white, red/black/green, etc.)","Cultural symbol templates and stickers","Greeting phrase strips in French and other languages","Markers, crayons, colored pencils (25 sets)","Glue sticks and safety scissors","Cultural celebration reference posters","Completed student greeting cards","Card presentation area","Cultural greeting phrase reminders"]',NULL,'Cartes de vœux multiculturelles','Greeting card exploration: Show beautiful example cards from different cultures and celebrations. Students practice different cultural greetings with gestures. Introduce card-making as way to share celebration wishes with others.','Multicultural card creation workshop: Students choose which cultural celebration card to make, then create personalized greeting cards using appropriate cultural symbols, colors, and greetings. Focus on respectful representation and personal creativity.','Card sharing and gifting circle: Students present their cards and practice giving them with appropriate cultural greetings. Exchange cards with classmates or prepare to take home to families. Appreciate diversity of celebrations represented.','Décrire le concept de cartes de; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer l''expression écrite par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653497,1757594654064,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Provide pre-made card templates with simple decoration tasks","Focus on one cultural celebration at a time","Use stickers and pre-cut shapes for easier assembly","Accept simple drawings or symbols"],"pourAvancés":["Create multiple cards for different celebrations","Learn and write greetings in different languages","Add detailed cultural symbols and explanations","Help classmates with card-making techniques"],"pourLangue":["Include cards for celebrations from home cultures","Use visual symbols rather than text when helpful","Allow home language greetings with French translations","Focus on universal card-making and gift-giving concepts"],"pourPEI":["Adapt card-making materials for fine motor needs","Provide alternative decoration methods (stamps, stickers)","Use preferred cultural themes or celebrations","Allow flexible participation in card creation and sharing"]}','{"vocabulary":["carte","bonjour","merci"],"visualSupports":["Multicultural greeting card display, greeting gesture reference chart, card-giving etiquette pictures","Cultural symbol and color meaning charts, greeting phrase pronunciation guides, respectful cultural representation guidelines, card-making instruction steps","Card presentation and gifting etiquette poster, cultural greeting reference, appreciation and gratitude visual supports"],"movementBreaks":["Cultural greeting gestures and practice","Card-giving demonstration movements","Card creation hand movements","Cultural symbol tracing and drawing","Card decoration activities","Card presentation movements","Greeting gestures","Card exchange activities"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,17,'extension',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y200i1vj9ths34xxmr',23,'Spectacle de talents d''hiver','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',4102416000000,45,'Talent show warm-up: Students practice being good audience members with gentle applause, appreciation gestures, and encouraging faces. Review performance options from winter celebration unit and let students choose their talent to share.','Winter celebration talent show: Students take turns performing their chosen talents - songs, dances, stories, or demonstrations from different winter celebrations. Each performance celebrated with audience appreciation and cultural context sharing.','Talent show celebration finale: Group appreciation circle where each performer receives specific positive feedback. End with group celebration of all talents shared and cultures represented. Document special moments.','Appliquer les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer l''expression écrite par des activités langagières variées','["Performance option cards with pictures","Audience etiquette demonstration props","Talent choice recording sheet","Performance area with simple stage setup","Props from previous lessons (instruments, scarves, etc.)","Cultural context cards for each celebration","Performance encouragement signs","Simple costumes or props (optional)","Documentation materials for celebrating performances","Audience seating arrangement","Appreciation circle area","Positive feedback prompt cards","Group celebration materials","Documentation for portfolios"]',NULL,'Spectacle de talents d''hiver','Talent show warm-up: Students practice being good audience members with gentle applause, appreciation gestures, and encouraging faces. Review performance options from winter celebration unit and let students choose their talent to share.','Winter celebration talent show: Students take turns performing their chosen talents - songs, dances, stories, or demonstrations from different winter celebrations. Each performance celebrated with audience appreciation and cultural context sharing.','Talent show celebration finale: Group appreciation circle where each performer receives specific positive feedback. End with group celebration of all talents shared and cultures represented. Document special moments.','Appliquer les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer l''expression écrite par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653498,1757594654065,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Offer simple performance options (showing an item, humming a tune)","Allow partner or group performances","Focus on participation and effort over performance quality","Provide alternative ways to contribute (helping others, being excellent audience)"],"pourAvancés":["Encourage more complex performances combining multiple elements","Ask to help less confident performers","Add cultural explanation to their performances","Take leadership roles in talent show organization"],"pourLangue":["Allow performances in home language with cultural sharing","Use performance as universal expression beyond language","Encourage sharing cultural performances from home traditions","Focus on non-verbal performance options"],"pourPEI":["Adapt performance expectations to individual abilities and interests","Provide alternative participation methods","Use preferred performance styles or comfort levels","Allow flexible engagement in talent show activities"]}','{"vocabulary":["talent","spectacle","applaudir"],"visualSupports":["Good audience behavior poster, performance option visual menu, encouragement gesture cards","Performance stage area, cultural celebration context posters, audience appreciation reminders, performance encouragement displays","Appreciation feedback prompts, group celebration posters, performance celebration visual supports"],"movementBreaks":["Audience appreciation gesture practice","Performance choice movements and demonstrations","All performances involve movement, singing, dancing, or demonstration","Audience participation movements and responses","Appreciation circle movements","Group celebration gestures and responses"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,18,'extension',0);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y200i3vj9tn3jj79ol',23,'Interview avec les familles','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',4102416000000,45,'Family connection introduction: Students share photos or drawings of their families celebrating. Practice interview skills with simple questions like ''What do you like?'' and good listening. Introduce concept of learning from family knowledge.','Family interview preparation and practice: Students prepare interview questions, practice with partners, and create documentation materials to take home. Role-play respectful family interviews and prepare to share findings with class.','Interview commitment and sharing preview: Students commit to interviewing one family member about winter traditions. Share excitement about learning family stories. Plan for sharing findings in future lessons.','Créer la famille et ses membres; Utiliser les rôles familiaux avec respect; Développer l''expression écrite par des activités langagières variées','["Family photos or drawings from students","Simple interview question cards","Good listening demonstration props","Family interview question templates with pictures","Documentation sheets for recording family traditions","Interview practice props (pretend microphone, clipboards)","Family tradition sharing examples","Cultural appreciation and respect guidelines","Take-home interview materials for families","Interview commitment cards","Take-home family interview materials","Sharing preview planning sheet"]',NULL,'Interview avec les familles','Family connection introduction: Students share photos or drawings of their families celebrating. Practice interview skills with simple questions like ''What do you like?'' and good listening. Introduce concept of learning from family knowledge.','Family interview preparation and practice: Students prepare interview questions, practice with partners, and create documentation materials to take home. Role-play respectful family interviews and prepare to share findings with class.','Interview commitment and sharing preview: Students commit to interviewing one family member about winter traditions. Share excitement about learning family stories. Plan for sharing findings in future lessons.','Créer la famille et ses membres; Utiliser les rôles familiaux avec respect; Développer l''expression écrite par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653499,1757594654066,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Provide simple interview questions with pictures","Allow family interviews in any language with translation help","Focus on one simple question about family celebrations","Accept drawings or gestures to share family traditions"],"pourAvancés":["Create more detailed interview questions","Help classmates prepare for family interviews","Research cultural background of family traditions","Prepare presentations about family cultural heritage"],"pourLangue":["Encourage interviews in home language with family translation","Focus on universal family connection elements","Allow sharing family traditions from home countries","Use family interviews to bridge home and school cultures"],"pourPEI":["Adapt interview methods to individual communication needs","Provide alternative family connection activities","Use preferred family members or community connections","Allow flexible participation in family tradition sharing"]}','{"vocabulary":["famille","célébrer","spécial"],"visualSupports":["Family celebration photo examples, interview question picture cards, good listening behavior poster","Family interview question cards with pictures, respectful questioning guidelines, family tradition documentation templates, cultural appreciation posters","Family interview commitment poster, sharing preview visual supports, family appreciation and gratitude cards"],"movementBreaks":["Family sharing gestures","Good listening position practice","Interview question practice movements","Interview practice role-play activities","Documentation preparation movements","Partnership interview practice","Commitment gestures","Excitement sharing movements","Family appreciation expressions"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,19,'core',0);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y300i5vj9tq97imur7',23,'Calendrier de célébrations d''hiver','cmf43u3xm00h1vj9teoqunlx5',1769011200000,45,'Learning journey reflection: Display all student work from winter celebration unit around the room. Students take appreciation walk to remember all celebrations learned. Introduce calendar as way to organize and remember celebration learning.','Collaborative winter celebration calendar creation: Students work together to create large class calendar marking all celebrations studied. Add decorations, pictures, and cultural elements for each celebration. Include family traditions shared from interviews.','Calendar celebration and unit reflection: Present completed class winter celebration calendar. Students share favorite memory from winter celebration learning. Celebrate accomplishment of learning about many cultures and traditions.','Maîtriser les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer l''expression écrite par la célébration collective','["All student work from previous 19 lessons displayed","Learning journey photo documentation","Calendar introduction materials","Large winter calendar template (December-February)","Cultural celebration date information cards","Decoration materials from all celebrations studied","Student artwork and crafts from previous lessons","Family tradition information from interviews","Markers, crayons, glue sticks (25 sets)","Cultural celebration timeline reference","Photos from all previous lessons","Completed class winter celebration calendar","Unit reflection prompts","Celebration accomplishment materials"]',NULL,'Calendrier de célébrations d''hiver','Learning journey reflection: Display all student work from winter celebration unit around the room. Students take appreciation walk to remember all celebrations learned. Introduce calendar as way to organize and remember celebration learning.','Collaborative winter celebration calendar creation: Students work together to create large class calendar marking all celebrations studied. Add decorations, pictures, and cultural elements for each celebration. Include family traditions shared from interviews.','Calendar celebration and unit reflection: Present completed class winter celebration calendar. Students share favorite memory from winter celebration learning. Celebrate accomplishment of learning about many cultures and traditions.','Maîtriser les caractéristiques de l''hiver et leurs effets; Utiliser les phénomènes hivernaux; Développer l''expression écrite par la célébration collective',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève utilise 3 nouveaux mots français dans ses phrases","L''élève prononce clairement les sons français ciblés","L''élève comprend les instructions avec les nouveaux mots","L''élève fait les gestes associés aux mots appris"],"checkpoints":["Reconnaît les mots à l''oral sans aide visuelle","Peut répéter les mots avec la bonne prononciation","Utilise les mots en contexte approprié","Montre compréhension par actions ou réponses"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653500,1757594654067,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Focus on simple calendar decoration activities","Use picture prompts for celebration memory","Accept participation in any form of calendar creation","Celebrate individual contributions to group calendar"],"pourAvancés":["Add detailed cultural information to calendar entries","Help organize and coordinate calendar creation activities","Research additional celebration dates to include","Create mini-presentations about calendar celebrations"],"pourLangue":["Include celebrations from home cultures in calendar","Use calendar as visual summary of cultural learning","Allow celebration descriptions in home language with translation","Focus on visual calendar creation over text"],"pourPEI":["Adapt calendar activities for individual abilities and interests","Provide alternative ways to contribute to calendar creation","Use preferred celebration elements for calendar decoration","Allow flexible participation in collaborative calendar project"]}','{"vocabulary":["calendrier","mémoire","ensemble"],"visualSupports":["Winter celebration learning journey display, calendar concept introduction poster, celebration memory prompts","Cultural celebration date reference charts, calendar creation instruction cards, celebration timeline visual supports, multicultural calendar examples","Unit accomplishment poster, reflection sharing prompts, celebration and gratitude visual supports"],"movementBreaks":["Appreciation walk around room","Memory sharing gestures","Calendar introduction movements","Calendar decoration activities","Collaborative creation movements","Cultural element placement activities","Calendar presentation movements","Celebration accomplishment gestures","Unit reflection sharing"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,20,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y500i9vj9tu10g8mzr',23,'Ma voix spéciale','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769097600000,45,'Explore different voices - whisper, loud, high, low. Point to throat and say ''voix''. Everyone practices saying their name with their special voice.','Voice exploration games - students experiment with volume, pitch, and expression. Practice ''Bonjour'' in different ways. Record some voices if technology available.','Circle sharing - each student says one word in their special voice. Celebrate the uniqueness of each voice.','Explorer le concept de ma voix; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées','["Miroir de classe","Cartes d''images voix (chuchoter, crier, chanter)","Enregistreur audio (si disponible)","Tableau des volumes 1-5","lingettes pour nettoyer les mains (1 paquet)","boîte de rangement pour travaux (1 grande boîte)","tampons motivants avec encreur (5 tampons)"]',NULL,'Ma voix spéciale','Explore different voices - whisper, loud, high, low. Point to throat and say ''voix''. Everyone practices saying their name with their special voice.','Voice exploration games - students experiment with volume, pitch, and expression. Practice ''Bonjour'' in different ways. Record some voices if technology available.','Circle sharing - each student says one word in their special voice. Celebrate the uniqueness of each voice.','Explorer le concept de ma voix; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Participe à l''exploration vocale","Démontre confort avec sa voix","Respecte les autres voix"],"checkpoints":["Essaie différents volumes","Partage sa voix spéciale","Écoute avec respect"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653502,1757594654071,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Commencer par des sons familiers (animaux)","Support en petit groupe","Imiter d''abord avant créer"],"pourAvancés":["Expérimenter avec accents différents","Créer des histoires avec voix","Diriger l''exploration du groupe"],"pourLangue":["Support visuel avec gestes","Encourager mélange L1/français","Partenaire francophone"],"pourPEI":["Volume personnalisé selon confort","Support technologique si nécessaire","Temps additionnel"]}','{"vocabulary":["voix","parler","écouter"],"visualSupports":["Images des parties du corps (gorge, bouche) pour expliquer la voix","Affiche des différents types de voix (forte, douce, aiguë, grave)","Cercle de partage au sol avec coussin spécial pour le partage"],"movementBreaks":["Étirements du cou et des épaules","Respirations profondes","Exercices de respiration","Étirements faciaux","Dire au revoir avec tout notre corps : mains, têtes, pieds (2 minutes)","Étirer notre dos d''écrivains : rotation douce des épaules (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,1,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y600ibvj9t5cnermmx',23,'Montrer et dire','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769184000000,45,'Review using our voices. Today we use voice to share special things. Model with teacher''s special item.','Traditional show and tell with French vocabulary support. Students show item and say 2-3 simple French words about it. Use ''Voici...'' and ''J''aime...'' sentence starters.','Reflection on sharing - students say one thing they learned about a classmate today.','Identifier le concept de montrer et; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées','["Objet spécial de l''enseignant(e) pour modèle","Cartes visuelles des phrases de départ","Objets variés pour pratique","tampons motivants avec encreur (5 tampons)","chemises individuelles (30 chemises)","lingettes pour nettoyer les mains (1 paquet)"]',NULL,'Montrer et dire','Review using our voices. Today we use voice to share special things. Model with teacher''s special item.','Traditional show and tell with French vocabulary support. Students show item and say 2-3 simple French words about it. Use ''Voici...'' and ''J''aime...'' sentence starters.','Reflection on sharing - students say one thing they learned about a classmate today.','Identifier le concept de montrer et; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Partage objet personnel","Utilise phrases françaises","Écoute respectueusement"],"checkpoints":["Apporte quelque chose de spécial","Utilise ''Voici'' ou ''J''aime''","Participe au partage"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653502,1757594654072,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Support pour choisir objet simple","Phrases pré-écrites disponibles","Présentation avec aide"],"pourAvancés":["Phrases complexes","Questions du public","Histoire derrière l''objet"],"pourLangue":["Support visuel pour phrases","Mélange de langues accepté","Traduction si nécessaire"],"pourPEI":["Format adapté aux besoins","Temps flexible","Support technologique"]}','{"vocabulary":["montrer","dire","partager"],"visualSupports":["Phrases de départ sur affiche : ''Voici...'', ''J''aime...'', ''C''est important parce que...''","Modèles de phrases : ''Voici mon/ma...'', ''J''aime ça parce que...''","Questions de réflexion au tableau : ''Qu''est-ce que j''ai appris?'', ''Qu''est-ce qui m''a surpris?''"],"movementBreaks":["Se lever pour montrer objet","Applaudir chaque présentation","Circulation pour voir objets","Applaudissements debout","Étirer notre dos d''écrivains : rotation douce des épaules (2 minutes)","Dire au revoir avec tout notre corps : mains, têtes, pieds (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,2,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y700idvj9tb8fz9sdp',23,'Gestes qui parlent','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769443200000,45,'Review using voice to share. Today explore how body ''talks'' too. Model gestures for hello, goodbye, happy, sad.','Gesture games - students communicate ideas using only body language, then add French words. Practice common gestures and their meanings.','Silent communication challenge - students communicate one idea to partner using only gestures.','Reconnaître le concept de gestes qui; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées','["Cartes d''images émotions/actions pour gestes","Cartes scenarios simples","Minuteur pour tours de rôle","lingettes pour nettoyer les mains (1 paquet)","chemises individuelles (30 chemises)","boîte de rangement pour travaux (1 grande boîte)"]',NULL,'Gestes qui parlent','Review using voice to share. Today explore how body ''talks'' too. Model gestures for hello, goodbye, happy, sad.','Gesture games - students communicate ideas using only body language, then add French words. Practice common gestures and their meanings.','Silent communication challenge - students communicate one idea to partner using only gestures.','Reconnaître le concept de gestes qui; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Utilise gestes pour communiquer","Comprend gestes des autres","Respecte différents styles de communication"],"checkpoints":["Essaie différents gestes","Communique sans mots","Interprète gestes d''autrui"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653503,1757594654073,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Gestes simples et évidents","Imitation d''abord","Support en petit groupe"],"pourAvancés":["Gestes complexes et créatifs","Séquences de gestes","Enseigner aux autres"],"pourLangue":["Gestes universels d''abord","Comparaison avec culture d''origine","Support visuel constant"],"pourPEI":["Gestes adaptés aux capacités","Support physique si nécessaire","Alternative communication"]}','{"vocabulary":["geste","corps","communication"],"visualSupports":["Affiche des gestes de base : bonjour, au revoir, content, triste","Exemples visuels des gestes communs dans notre culture","Liste des gestes appris pour référence"],"movementBreaks":["Étirements des bras et mains","Gestes de relaxation","Mouvement libre créatif","Étirements guidés","Dire au revoir avec tout notre corps : mains, têtes, pieds (2 minutes)","Célébrer nos apprentissages : applaudir, lever les bras, sourire (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,3,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y800ifvj9ticcd8kqw',23,'Écouter avec attention','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769529600000,45,'Review using voice and body to communicate. Today focus on the other side - listening! Put on ''listening ears''.','Listening practice with partners - one student shares, other practices active listening and asking simple questions using ''Qu''est-ce que...?'' and ''Pourquoi...?''','Reflect on what makes good listening. Students share what they learned by listening carefully today.','Exprimer le concept de écouter avec; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées','["Oreilles en papier pour ''oreilles d''écoute''","Cartes de questions de départ","Minuteur pour tours d''écoute","étiquettes autocollantes (2 planches)","boîte de rangement pour travaux (1 grande boîte)","certificats d''encouragement (30 copies)"]',NULL,'Écouter avec attention','Review using voice and body to communicate. Today focus on the other side - listening! Put on ''listening ears''.','Listening practice with partners - one student shares, other practices active listening and asking simple questions using ''Qu''est-ce que...?'' and ''Pourquoi...?''','Reflect on what makes good listening. Students share what they learned by listening carefully today.','Exprimer le concept de écouter avec; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la conscience phonologique par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Démontre écoute active","Pose questions appropriées","Respecte temps de parole"],"checkpoints":["Maintient contact visuel","Pose au moins une question","Répond de façon pertinente"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653504,1757594654074,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Écoute en petits groupes","Support visuel pour questions","Modèles de questions simples"],"pourAvancés":["Questions complexes et de suivi","Aide aux pairs","Résumé de ce qu''ils entendent"],"pourLangue":["Questions en français et anglais OK","Support visuel pour compréhension","Partenaire patient"],"pourPEI":["Format adapté aux besoins auditifs","Support technologique","Temps flexible"]}','{"vocabulary":["attention","question","répondre"],"visualSupports":["Affiche des signes d''un bon auditeur : yeux, oreilles, bouche fermée","Exemples de bonnes questions : ''Qu''est-ce que...?'', ''Pourquoi...?''","Critères d''écoute affichés : attention, questions, respect"],"movementBreaks":["Exercices d''oreilles (toucher, bouger)","Position d''écoute spéciale","Changement de partenaires","Étirements d''écoute","Dire au revoir avec tout notre corps : mains, têtes, pieds (2 minutes)","Étirer notre dos d''écrivains : rotation douce des épaules (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,4,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y800ihvj9t5hoaje4o',23,'Raconter mes aventures','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769616000000,45,'Review good listening and sharing. Today tell adventure stories! Model simple adventure with sequence words.','Students share simple personal adventures (playground, home, weekend) using ''D''abord...'', ''Ensuite...'', ''Finalement...'' Support with visual sequence cards.','Celebrate adventurous storytellers. Practice sequence words together as group.','Décrire le concept de raconter mes; Raconter les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer le vocabulaire français par la narration','["Cartes de séquence (1, 2, 3)","Cartes visuelles de séquence 1-2-3","Images d''aventures pour inspiration","chemises individuelles (30 chemises)","certificats d''encouragement (30 copies)","tampons motivants avec encreur (5 tampons)"]',NULL,'Raconter mes aventures','Review good listening and sharing. Today tell adventure stories! Model simple adventure with sequence words.','Students share simple personal adventures (playground, home, weekend) using ''D''abord...'', ''Ensuite...'', ''Finalement...'' Support with visual sequence cards.','Celebrate adventurous storytellers. Practice sequence words together as group.','Décrire le concept de raconter mes; Raconter les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer le vocabulaire français par la narration',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Utilise mots de séquence","Raconte aventure personnelle","Structure histoire logiquement"],"checkpoints":["Dit ''D''abord''","Ajoute ''Ensuite''","Conclut histoire"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653505,1757594654075,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Support visuel constant pour séquence","Aventures très simples","Aide pour structurer récit"],"pourAvancés":["Plus d''étapes dans séquence","Détails riches","Questions du public encouragées"],"pourLangue":["Mélange séquence en deux langues OK","Support visuel fort","Partenaire pour aider"],"pourPEI":["Format adapté (dessin, gestes)","Support technologique","Temps flexible"]}','{"vocabulary":["aventure","d''abord","ensuite"],"visualSupports":["Mots de séquence sur affiche : ''D''abord'', ''Ensuite'', ''Finalement''","Support visuel avec images pour ''D''abord'', ''Ensuite'', ''Finalement''","Mots de séquence restent affichés pour référence"],"movementBreaks":["Actions pour ''d''abord, ensuite, finalement''","Marche séquentielle","Gestes pour chaque étape","Marche d''aventure","Dire au revoir avec tout notre corps : mains, têtes, pieds (2 minutes)","Étirer notre dos d''écrivains : rotation douce des épaules (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,5,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3y900ijvj9t1h3y9xek',23,'Personnages vivants','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769702400000,45,'Review adventure storytelling. Today make characters come alive with special voices and movements!','Character exploration - students practice different character voices (big/small, happy/sad, fast/slow) and movements. Create simple character scenarios.','Character parade - students briefly demonstrate their favorite character voice and movement.','Lire le concept de personnages vivants; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer le vocabulaire français par des activités langagières variées','["Images de personnages variés (animaux, personnes)","Cartes de personnages","Foulards ou accessoires simples","boîte de rangement pour travaux (1 grande boîte)","certificats d''encouragement (30 copies)","tampons motivants avec encreur (5 tampons)"]',NULL,'Personnages vivants','Review adventure storytelling. Today make characters come alive with special voices and movements!','Character exploration - students practice different character voices (big/small, happy/sad, fast/slow) and movements. Create simple character scenarios.','Character parade - students briefly demonstrate their favorite character voice and movement.','Lire le concept de personnages vivants; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer le vocabulaire français par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Expérimente avec voix différentes","Ajoute mouvement aux personnages","Partage créations avec confiance"],"checkpoints":["Crée au moins un personnage","Change sa voix","Participe à la parade"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653506,1757594654076,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Personnages très familiers","Voix simples seulement","Support en petit groupe"],"pourAvancés":["Personnages complexes","Combinaison voix-mouvement","Improvisation de scènes"],"pourLangue":["Personnages universels","Support visuel pour caractéristiques","Expression non-verbale encouragée"],"pourPEI":["Personnages adaptés aux capacités","Modifications physiques au besoin","Participation à son niveau"]}','{"vocabulary":["personnage","voix","bouger"],"visualSupports":["Affiche des types de personnages avec leurs voix","Exemples visuels : grand/petit, rapide/lent, content/triste","Espace désigné pour la parade"],"movementBreaks":["Étirements créatifs","Transformation physique libre","Faire une révérence à nos nouvelles connaissances (1 minute)","Célébrer nos apprentissages : applaudir, lever les bras, sourire (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,6,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3ya00ilvj9t6qltfgbj',23,'Émotions expressives','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1769788800000,45,'Review character voices. Today explore how emotions change our voice and face. Model happy vs. sad voice.','Emotion exploration - students practice expressing different emotions through facial expressions and voice tone. Use scenarios to practice appropriate emotional responses.','Emotion check-in - students share how they''re feeling using French emotion words and expressions.','Écrire les émotions de base; Utiliser des stratégies de gestion émotionnelle; Développer le vocabulaire français par des activités langagières variées','["Miroir de classe","Cartes d''émotions avec visages","Scénarios simples sur cartes","Miroirs individuels si disponibles","boîte de rangement pour travaux (1 grande boîte)","étiquettes autocollantes (2 planches)","certificats d''encouragement (30 copies)"]',NULL,'Émotions expressives','Review character voices. Today explore how emotions change our voice and face. Model happy vs. sad voice.','Emotion exploration - students practice expressing different emotions through facial expressions and voice tone. Use scenarios to practice appropriate emotional responses.','Emotion check-in - students share how they''re feeling using French emotion words and expressions.','Écrire les émotions de base; Utiliser des stratégies de gestion émotionnelle; Développer le vocabulaire français par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Exprime émotions avec visage","Change voix selon émotion","Reconnaît émotions chez autrui"],"checkpoints":["Montre content et triste","Utilise mots d''émotions","Participe avec respect"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653507,1757594654077,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Émotions de base seulement","Support avec objets","Expression non-verbale prioritaire"],"pourAvancés":["Émotions complexes","Nuances d''expression","Aide aux pairs pour reconnaissance"],"pourLangue":["Émotions universelles d''abord","Support visuel constant","Comparaison interculturelle"],"pourPEI":["Adaptations pour confort émotionnel","Expression au niveau de capacité","Soutien supplémentaire si nécessaire"]}','{"vocabulary":["émotion","content","triste"],"visualSupports":["Roue des émotions avec expressions faciales","Affiche des émotions principales avec mots français","Thermomètre des émotions pour auto-évaluation"],"movementBreaks":["Exercices faciaux amusants","Mouvements d''émotions corporelles","Ranger nos idées : faire semblant de mettre nos pensées dans une boîte (2 minutes)","Faire une révérence à nos nouvelles connaissances (1 minute)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,7,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3yb00invj9tvwlhjx06',23,'Jouer des scènes','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1770048000000,45,'Review expressing emotions. Today combine everything to act out real-life scenes with partners!','Partner drama - students act out simple scenarios (ordering food, asking for help, greeting friends) using voice, emotion, and character skills.','Mini performances - few pairs share their scenes with class. Celebrate teamwork and creativity.','Raconter le concept de jouer des; Participer à les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer le vocabulaire français par des activités langagières variées','["Cartes de scénarios simples","Accessoires simples (chapeaux, foulards)","Minuteur pour scènes","chemises individuelles (30 chemises)","étiquettes autocollantes (2 planches)","tampons motivants avec encreur (5 tampons)"]',NULL,'Jouer des scènes','Review expressing emotions. Today combine everything to act out real-life scenes with partners!','Partner drama - students act out simple scenarios (ordering food, asking for help, greeting friends) using voice, emotion, and character skills.','Mini performances - few pairs share their scenes with class. Celebrate teamwork and creativity.','Raconter le concept de jouer des; Participer à les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer le vocabulaire français par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Collabore avec partenaire","Intègre voix et mouvement","Joue scène avec confiance"],"checkpoints":["Participe en équipe","Utilise compétences apprises","Respecte partenaire"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653507,1757594654078,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Scénarios très simples","Rôles précis assignés","Support constant"],"pourAvancés":["Scénarios complexes","Improvisation libre","Leadership dans groupes"],"pourLangue":["Scénarios universels","Gestes prioritaires","Support de partenaire francophone"],"pourPEI":["Adaptations pour interactions sociales","Rôles selon forces","Support pour anxiité sociale"]}','{"vocabulary":["jouer","scène","ensemble"],"visualSupports":["Exemples de scènes à jouer avec illustrations","Guide visuel pour expressions faciales et gestes","Espace de performance désigné"],"movementBreaks":["Échauffement théâtral","Changement de partenaires avec mouvement","Étirer notre dos d''écrivains : rotation douce des épaules (2 minutes)","Célébrer nos apprentissages : applaudir, lever les bras, sourire (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,8,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3yc00ipvj9tibzb3scc',23,'Présenter mes créations','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1770134400000,45,'Review acting scenes together. Today be solo presenters sharing our own special creations!','Art presentation - students present their artwork or projects using simple French descriptions. Practice explaining process and meaning.','Audience appreciation - students practice giving positive feedback using simple French phrases.','Communiquer le concept de présenter mes; Créer les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la communication orale par la création personnelle','["Créations d''élèves (dessins, projets)","Chevalet ou support d''affichage","Pointeur pour montrer détails","chemises individuelles (30 chemises)","étiquettes autocollantes (2 planches)","boîte de rangement pour travaux (1 grande boîte)"]',NULL,'Présenter mes créations','Review acting scenes together. Today be solo presenters sharing our own special creations!','Art presentation - students present their artwork or projects using simple French descriptions. Practice explaining process and meaning.','Audience appreciation - students practice giving positive feedback using simple French phrases.','Communiquer le concept de présenter mes; Créer les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la communication orale par la création personnelle',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Présente sa création","Utilise vocabulaire descriptif","Démontre fierté dans travail"],"checkpoints":["Montre sa création","Explique un aspect","Accepte félicitations"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653508,1757594654079,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Créations très simples OK","Phrases courtes suffisantes","Support pour expliquer"],"pourAvancés":["Détails complexes","Questions techniques","Aide aux pairs presenters"],"pourLangue":["Description en deux langues OK","Support visuel pour mots","Focus sur fierté plutôt que perfection"],"pourPEI":["Format adapté aux forces","Présentation modifiée","Soutien émotionnel"]}','{"vocabulary":["présenter","création","expliquer"],"visualSupports":["Phrases pour présenter : ''J''ai fait...'', ''J''aime ça parce que...''","Guide des mots descriptifs : couleurs, formes, sentiments","Phrases de félicitations : ''Bravo!'', ''J''aime...'', ''C''est beau!''"],"movementBreaks":["Préparation créative debout","Tour de la classe pour voir créations","Faire une révérence à nos nouvelles connaissances (1 minute)","Célébrer nos apprentissages : applaudir, lever les bras, sourire (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',1,9,'core',1);
INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u3yd00irvj9th8iin6wr',23,'Questions curieuses','cmf43u3y400i7vj9tu1eu69f8',1770220800000,45,'Review presenting our work. Today be curious audience members who ask great questions!','Question practice - students present briefly while others practice asking thoughtful questions using ''Pourquoi...?'', ''Comment...?'', ''Qu''est-ce que...?''','Celebrate good questions asked today. Discuss how questions help us learn about each other.','Exprimer le concept de questions curieuses; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la communication orale par des activités langagières variées','["Cartes de questions exemple","Minuteur pour présentations courtes","Cartes d''aide questions","étiquettes autocollantes (2 planches)","certificats d''encouragement (30 copies)","lingettes pour nettoyer les mains (1 paquet)"]',NULL,'Questions curieuses','Review presenting our work. Today be curious audience members who ask great questions!','Question practice - students present briefly while others practice asking thoughtful questions using ''Pourquoi...?'', ''Comment...?'', ''Qu''est-ce que...?''','Celebrate good questions asked today. Discuss how questions help us learn about each other.','Exprimer le concept de questions curieuses; Utiliser les compétences langagières fondamentales; Développer la communication orale par des activités langagières variées',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["Pose questions aux pairs","Montre curiosité authentique","Écoute réponses avec attention"],"checkpoints":["Essaie de poser question","Utilise mots question","Respecte réponses d''autrui"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653509,1757594654080,1,'fr','Français (Immersion)','{"pourDifficultés":["Questions très simples","Aide pour formuler","Questions oui/non OK"],"pourAvancés":["Questions détaillées","Questions de suivi","Aide à formuler questions complexes"],"pourLangue":["Questions dans deux langues OK","Support visuel 