INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u4a2017hvj9t6b6ug2pb',23,'Notre livre scientifique de printemps','cmf43u49p016pvj9txx3n7ot7',1770739200000,45,'Celebrating spring learning (8 min): Review all the amazing spring discoveries from Lessons 1-13. Show students their accumulated work: observation sheets, drawings, garden journals. Announce special project: creating a book about our spring science journey!','Spring science book creation (27 min): Collaborative documentation project synthesizing all spring learning into class book. Students organize their drawings, observations, and discoveries into book sections: spring signs, plant growth, animal activity, flowers and insects, our garden. Practice vocabulary: ''Nous documentons nos découvertes.'' Students contribute pages showing their best spring observations with drawings and simple captions. Create book sections for: what we learned about spring weather, plant changes, animal behaviors, experiments we did. Students practice presenting their pages to classmates.','Book completion celebration (10 min): Students share favorite pages from spring science book. Discuss how their book shows all the amazing things they learned about spring. Plan to share book with families or other classes. End with proud scientist celebration dance.','Prédire les signes du printemps dans la nature; Expérimenter avec les transformations printanières; Développer l''esprit critique par l''investigation scientifique','["Tableau des découvertes de la leçon précédente","Images thématiques pour introduction","Cartes vocabulaire visuelles","Feuilles d''observation thématique (25)","Planchettes à pince (13 pour binômes)","Crayons de couleur","Matériaux d''exploration spécifiques au thème","Grand papier graphique pour création collective","Marqueurs de couleur","Création collective complétée","Matériaux de démonstration finale"]',NULL,'Notre livre scientifique de printemps','Celebrating spring learning (8 min): Review all the amazing spring discoveries from Lessons 1-13. Show students their accumulated work: observation sheets, drawings, garden journals. Announce special project: creating a book about our spring science journey!','Spring science book creation (27 min): Collaborative documentation project synthesizing all spring learning into class book. Students organize their drawings, observations, and discoveries into book sections: spring signs, plant growth, animal activity, flowers and insects, our garden. Practice vocabulary: ''Nous documentons nos découvertes.'' Students contribute pages showing their best spring observations with drawings and simple captions. Create book sections for: what we learned about spring weather, plant changes, animal behaviors, experiments we did. Students practice presenting their pages to classmates.','Book completion celebration (10 min): Students share favorite pages from spring science book. Discuss how their book shows all the amazing things they learned about spring. Plan to share book with families or other classes. End with proud scientist celebration dance.','Prédire les signes du printemps dans la nature; Expérimenter avec les transformations printanières; Développer l''esprit critique par l''investigation scientifique',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève participe activement aux explorations scientifiques","L''élève utilise vocabulaire thématique approprié","L''élève fait des observations pertinentes sur le thème","L''élève établit des connexions avec expériences personnelles et apprentissages antérieurs"],"checkpoints":["5 min: Vérifier engagement initial et compréhension du thème","15 min: Observer qualité des explorations et interactions","25 min: Noter contributions aux discussions et créations collectives","Fin: Évaluer démonstrations finales et compréhension globale du concept"]}',1,'Plan détaillé avec supports visuels',1756911653930,1757594654578,1,'fr','Sciences de la nature','{"pourDifficultés":["Fournir guides visuels simples avec i