ice","Allow for shorter presentation length if full demonstration feels overwhelming"],"pourAvancés":["Include practicing with timing and pacing for efficient presentations","Encourage students to practice handling unexpected situations or questions","Challenge students to help support classmates during their final practice"],"pourLangue":["Allow use of visual cues and props to support verbal presentation","Practice key transition phrases: ''D''abord'', ''Maintenant'', ''Finalement'', ''Merci''","Focus on clear communication over perfect French pronunciation"],"pourPEI":["Provide calm, supportive environment with familiar audience members","Allow breaks between presentation components if needed","Focus on celebrating completion and effort rather than performance evaluation"]}','{"vocabulary":["répétition","générale","prêt"],"visualSupports":["Final preparation checklist and confidence affirmation cards","Performance flow chart and timing guidelines"],"movementBreaks":["Former des lettres dans l''air avec nos doigts : A, B, C (3 minutes)","Répéter des comptines avec gestes : ''Tête, épaules, genoux et pieds'' (2 minutes)","Faire des gestes de marionnettes pour raconter notre histoire (3 minutes)","Faire une pause lecture : s''étirer comme un chat qui se réveille (2 minutes)","Ranger nos idées : faire semblant de mettre nos pensées dans une boîte (2 minutes)","Étirer notre dos d''écrivains : rotation douce des épaules (2 minutes)"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"questions":["Les élèves ont-ils atteint les objectifs?","Quelles adaptations étaient nécessaires?","Que ferais-je différemment la prochaine fois?"]}',NULL,'',3,16,'extension',1);
