INSERT INTO ETFOLessonPlan VALUES('cmf43u4fb01j7vj9tuf9mqlio',23,'Créer une carte de notre communauté','cmf43u4ey01idvj9tbdecuzuo',1765209600000,45,'Map-making circle where students share places they know in their community. Practice mapping vocabulary with directional gestures and location expressions.','Community map creation using simple base maps or drawing from scratch. Students add community helper locations, important places, and autumn features to create personalized community maps showing where helpers work and families visit.','Map sharing circle where students show their community maps and practice describing locations with ''Sur ma carte, je vois...''','Comprendre la communauté locale; Créer les interactions sociales positives; Développer la conscience culturelle par l''interaction sociale','["simple community maps","mapping vocabulary cards","directional gesture demonstrations","base maps or large paper","mapping supplies","community location stickers","colored pencils","support d''affichage pour cartes","autocollants de cartographe","cartes de partage"]',NULL,'Créer une carte de notre communauté','Map-making circle where students share places they know in their community. Practice mapping vocabulary with directional gestures and location expressions.','Community map creation using simple base maps or drawing from scratch. Students add community helper locations, important places, and autumn features to create personalized community maps showing where helpers work and families visit.','Map sharing circle where students show their community maps and practice describing locations with ''Sur ma carte, je vois...''','Comprendre la communauté locale; Créer les interactions sociales positives; Développer la conscience culturelle par l''interaction sociale',NULL,NULL,NULL,'formative','{"observable":["L''élève respecte les différences entre les personnes et cultures","L''élève explique les règles importantes de la communauté","L''élève décrit comment il peut ai