INSERT INTO UnitPlan VALUES('cmf43u3ui00a3vj9to9pgq6bi',23,'amities','cmebyc98x000bvjr1finmuibw',replace('Construire et maintenir des relations saines avec les pairs et la famille\n\n🌟 MODÈLE CORE + EXTENSION (19 leçons):\n• Leçons essentielles (70%): 13 leçons - concepts fondamentaux obligatoires\n• Leçons d''extension (30%): 6 leçons - enrichissement et projets personnalisés\n\nCette structure flexible permet d''adapter l''enseignement aux besoins variés des élèves tout en assurant la maîtrise des concepts essentiels pour tous.\n\n🛡️ PROTOCOLES DE SÉCURITÉ ÉMOTIONNELLE:\n• Environnement de confiance et respect absolu\n• Aucune obligation de partage personnel\n• Validation constante des émotions de chaque élève\n• Support individuel disponible en tout temps\n• Communication transparente avec les familles','\n',char(10)),'Understanding ourselves helps us connect with others. We can make healthy choices for our bodies and minds. Everyone''s feelings matter.','[]','2025-11-17T00:00:00Z','2025-12-05T23:59:59Z',NULL,'amities','','','Self-reflection journals, peer interaction observations, healthy choice demonstrations, conflict resolution skills, growth portfolios.',NULL,1756911653370,1756911653370,'Health professionals visiting, family wellness activities, community sports programs, mental health awareness, safety partnerships.','**Français**: Emotion vocabulary, expressing feelings. **Sciences**: Body systems, healthy habits. **Arts**: Expressing emotions through art. **Sciences humaines**: Being good community members.','Create a class book of "Nos amis de la classe" with photos and recorded greetings.','{"emerging":"Picture supports, gestures, repetition, buddy system","developing":"Simple sentence frames, choice of responses","extending":"Additional vocabulary, helping others, French reading corner"}','Outdoor physical activity benefits, nature for mental health, environmental factors in health, clean environment importance.','Community walks, guest speakers, virtu